From: ponwrt development <noreply@local>
Subject: [PATCH] mt7915: publish configured QoS under PPE worker fences

Shared datapath ABI 2 rejects mismatched host/firmware layouts.
Retain PN, A-MSDU, ownership, bridge fallback and recovery protections.

--- a/kite-datapath.h
+++ b/kite-datapath.h
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@
  */
